Automaton Worm extracts its Autonomous CA arena, rule engine, integer MLP
compiler, and rendering from automaton-swarm.

The seeded 32-bit generator is Tommy Ettinger's Mulberry32, released under
CC0 1.0. The Rust implementation uses Automata Core's bounded-index selection.
